# elastic-package build output (repo root only, not packages/*/_dev/build)
/build/
*.tar.gz

# Local development scratch, deliberately untracked. `notes/` holds research
# briefs on ServerPilot's API and log layout; `tools/` holds the scripts that
# generate dashboard design data, render the dashboard screenshots and replay
# real log files through an installed pipeline; `DESIGN.md` records why the
# load-bearing decisions were made. The package is self-contained without any
# of them: every decision they explain is also in the field descriptions, which
# ship with the package and render into its documentation.
/notes/
/tools/
/DESIGN.md

# Raw captures copied in for anonymization work still hold a real server's
# hostnames, addresses and request paths. The committed fixtures and sample
# events use RFC 5737 documentation addresses throughout.
_research/
